    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='New Dashboard'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1400' minheight='800' minwidth='1400' preset-index='17' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='9' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98858' x='571' y='1000'>
            <zone h='98000' id='7' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98858' x='571' y='1000'>
              <zone h='69250' id='3' name='Regression Plot' w='30051' x='31643' y='29750'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='18250' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='1000'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Interpretation of the Regression Line:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The regression plot shows a </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>positive correlation</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> between </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Income</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Customer Lifetime Value (CLV)</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. This means that as </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Income</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> increases, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Customer Lifetime Value</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> tends to increase as well.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Statistical Significance:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>The relationship between </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Income</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>CLV</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> is statistically significant, with a </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>P-value</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> of </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>0.01987</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>. Since this P-value is below the common threshold of </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>0.05</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, we can conclude that the observed positive relationship between </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Income</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>CLV</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> is unlikely to be due to chance.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='69250' id='6' name='Choropleth Map' w='31072' x='571' y='29750'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
